<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     10.50 /10.40   10.80 /10.70   11.40 /11.30</p>
<p> Citibank		10.55 /10.40   10.80 /10.65   11.375/11.25</p>
<p> HongKong Bank	 10.40 /10.25   10.90 /10.70   11.35 /11.25</p>
<p> Metrobank	     10.50 /10.275  10.825/10.60   11.40 /11.20</p>
<p> Multinational	 10.45 /10.30   10.75 /10.65   11.30 /11.15</p>
<p> Security Bank	 10.45 /10.30   10.90 /10.70   11.375/11.25</p>
<p> SolidBank	     10.60 /10.50   10.90 /10.80   11.40 /11.30</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     10.50 /10.25   10.90 /10.70   11.50 /11.25</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8938</p>
